POST  {{{{HostAddress}}}}/register
Content-Type: {{ContentType}}

{
	"email": "ron@example.com",
	"password": "demo1234"
}


### login user and get token
POST {{{{{HostAddress}}}}}/login
constent-Type: {{ContentType}}

{
	"email": "ron@example.com",
	"password": "demo1234"
}